### 1. Create a Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Developer Hardware"
}

### 2. Create the MacBook Pro Product (Assuming Category ID 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/1/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "16-inch M1 Pro MacBook Pro",
  "productDescription": "Perfect for backend engineering and running Docker containers.",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 2499.00,
  "discountedPrice": 2299.00
}

### 3. Get All Products (Pagination Check)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/products

### 4. The Chaos Test (Validation Check)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/1/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "",
  "productDescription": "This should fail.",
  "quantity": -5,
  "price": -100.00,
  "discountedPrice": 0.00
}




